    "created_at": "2016-04-15T20:35:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-15T20:35:38Z",
    "body": "The index section also needs to not be wrapped at 100 because there are line-based Perl scripts in `html-build` that copies attribute descriptions from the index to the relevant element's definition. Maybe there are other similar things. (Those Perl things should be moved into wattsi...)\n",
